{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"posts\":[{\"id\":15837,\"date\":\"2026-06-30T08:00:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-06-30T06:00:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-rilascia-ios-26-5-2-per-iphone-aggiornamento-solo-sicurezza\",\"title\":\"Apple rilascia iOS 26.5.2 per iPhone: aggiornamento solo sicurezza\",\"excerpt\":\"Apple ha rilasciato iOS 26.5.2 per iPhone: nessuna nuova funzione, solo correzioni di sicurezza. Stesse note anche per iPadOS 26.5.2 e macOS 26.5.2.\",\"categoryName\":\"iOS\",\"categorySlug\":\"ios\",\"categoryId\":14,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/06/ios-26.5.2-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"ios-26.5.2\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15841,\"date\":\"2026-06-29T21:43:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-06-29T19:43:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-terza-beta-ios-26-6-ipados-26-6-sviluppatori\",\"title\":\"Apple rilascia la terza beta di iOS 26.6 e iPadOS 26.6 agli sviluppatori\",\"excerpt\":\"Apple ha distribuito la terza beta di iOS 26.6 e iPadOS 26.6 agli sviluppatori per i test. L’aggiornamento arriverà a breve e punta soprattutto su correzioni e miglioramenti.\",\"categoryName\":\"iOS\",\"categorySlug\":\"ios\",\"categoryId\":14,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/06/iOS-26.6-Glass-Feature-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"iOS-26.6-Glass-Feature\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":2,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15687,\"date\":\"2026-06-24T08:00:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-06-24T06:00:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"ios-27-beta-2-novita-siri-wallet-rcs-homekit\",\"title\":\"iOS 27 beta 2: novità su Siri, Wallet, RCS e HomeKit\",\"excerpt\":\"Nella seconda beta di iOS 27 arrivano un nuovo pulsante “Write with Siri”, aggiornamenti alla personalizzazione della voce, “Insights” in Wallet, miglioramenti RCS e nuove funzioni per Apple TV e HomeKit.\",\"categoryName\":\"Tecnologia\",\"categorySlug\":\"tecnologia\",\"categoryId\":5,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/06/iOS-27-Feature-Dark-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"iOS-27-Feature-Dark\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15705,\"date\":\"2026-06-23T12:02:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-06-23T10:02:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-roadmap-fino-al-2027-20-prodotti-attesi\",\"title\":\"Apple: la roadmap fino al 2027 è enorme! Ecco i 20 prodotti attesi\",\"excerpt\":\"Una roadmap “fino al 2027” molto ampia: tra nuovi dispositivi, aggiornamenti di piattaforme e nuove categorie di prodotto, ecco i 20 elementi più discussi.\",\"categoryName\":\"Tecnologia\",\"categorySlug\":\"tecnologia\",\"categoryId\":5,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/06/apple-roadmap-2027-1-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"apple-roadmap-2027-1\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":2,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15689,\"date\":\"2026-06-23T08:00:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-06-23T06:00:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"macos-tahoe-26-5-2-ios-26-5-2-aggiornamenti-in-arrivo\",\"title\":\"macOS Tahoe 26.5.2 e iOS 26.5.2: aggiornamenti in arrivo\",\"excerpt\":\"Apple sta lavorando a macOS Tahoe 26.5.2 e iOS 26.5.2, attesi a breve insieme. Si tratta di update minori orientati a correzioni e sicurezza, mentre sono già in test le versioni 26.6.\",\"categoryName\":\"iOS\",\"categorySlug\":\"ios\",\"categoryId\":14,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/06/macos-tahoe-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"macos-tahoe\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":2,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15670,\"date\":\"2026-06-22T08:00:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-06-22T06:00:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-cinque-nuove-app-siri-ai-remote-find-my-watch-pass-designer\",\"title\":\"Apple presenta cinque nuove app: Siri AI, Remote, Find My su Watch e Pass Designer\",\"excerpt\":\"Da WWDC 2026 arrivano Siri AI con app dedicata, il ritorno di Apple TV Remote, la nuova app Find My su Apple Watch e Pass Designer per Wallet. In parallelo, Claris aggiorna FileMaker Go 2026.\",\"categoryName\":\"Intelligenza Artificiale\",\"categorySlug\":\"intelligenza-artificiale\",\"categoryId\":188,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/06/Apple-Logo-Spotlight-Blue-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Apple-Logo-Spotlight-Blue\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15636,\"date\":\"2026-06-20T12:02:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-06-20T10:02:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"iphone-18-pro-12-motivi-per-aspettare\",\"title\":\"iPhone 18 Pro: 12 motivi per aspettare il prossimo salto\",\"excerpt\":\"Dalla nuova strategia di rilascio a batterie più grandi, Dynamic Island più piccola, chip A20 e modem C2: ecco i principali motivi per aspettare iPhone 18 Pro.\",\"categoryName\":\"Tecnologia\",\"categorySlug\":\"tecnologia\",\"categoryId\":5,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/06/Dynamic-Island-iPhone-18-Pro-Feature-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Dynamic-Island-iPhone-18-Pro-Feature\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15629,\"date\":\"2026-06-20T08:44:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-06-20T06:44:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"ios-27-nuove-funzioni-dove-hide-location-durate-personalizzate-landscape\",\"title\":\"iOS 27 porta nuove funzioni in “Dov’è” su iPhone: Hide Location, durate personalizzate e modalità orizzontale\",\"excerpt\":\"Con iOS 27 arrivano tre novità per l’app Dov’è: “Hide Location” per sospendere la condivisione in modo discreto, durate personalizzate fino a 30 giorni e l’estensione della modalità orizzontale.\",\"categoryName\":\"iOS\",\"categorySlug\":\"ios\",\"categoryId\":14,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/06/iOS-27-and-Find-My-Feature-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"iOS-27-and-Find-My-Feature\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":3,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15627,\"date\":\"2026-06-20T08:22:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-06-20T06:22:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-cambia-app-store-brasile-marketplace-alternativi-pagamenti-terzi-ios\",\"title\":\"Apple cambia l’App Store in Brasile: marketplace alternativi e pagamenti terzi su iOS\",\"excerpt\":\"Dal rilascio su iOS 26.5, gli sviluppatori in Brasile potranno usare marketplace autorizzati da Apple e accettare pagamenti tramite piattaforme terze, con nuove commissioni e tutele per la sicurezza.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/06/iOS-App-Store-Icons-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"iOS-App-Store-Icons\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15604,\"date\":\"2026-06-18T08:22:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-06-18T06:22:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"webkit-su-ios-benchmark-divario-prestazioni-30\",\"title\":\"WebKit su iOS: benchmark indicano un divario di prestazioni vicino al 30%\",\"excerpt\":\"Un prototipo Chromium basato su BrowserEngineKit ottiene risultati superiori a Safari su iOS nei test Speedometer 3.1, JetStream 3 e MotionMark 1.3.1, evidenziando il peso delle regole WebKit.\",\"categoryName\":\"Tecnologia\",\"categorySlug\":\"tecnologia\",\"categoryId\":5,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/06/webkit-vs-chromium-feature-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"webkit-vs-chromium-feature\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":2,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15577,\"date\":\"2026-06-17T08:44:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-06-17T06:44:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"airpods-con-fotocamere-arrivo-2027-primo-wearable-ai-apple\",\"title\":\"AirPods con fotocamere in arrivo nel 2027: il primo wearable AI di Apple\",\"excerpt\":\"Apple starebbe lavorando a AirPods con fotocamere, pensate non per scattare foto, ma per alimentare Siri con informazioni sull’ambiente. Arrivo previsto tra fine 2027, insieme a iPhone per il 20° anniversario e a un nuovo iPhone pieghevole.\",\"categoryName\":\"Intelligenza Artificiale\",\"categorySlug\":\"intelligenza-artificiale\",\"categoryId\":188,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/06/airpods-pro-3-orange-768x432.jpeg\",\"imageAlt\":\"airpods-pro-3-orange\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":3,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15546,\"date\":\"2026-06-16T09:06:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-06-16T07:06:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-rilascia-beta-2-ios-26-6-e-versioni-per-ipados-macos-tvos-watchos-26\",\"title\":\"Apple rilascia la beta 2 di iOS 26.6 e le versioni per iOS, iPadOS, macOS, tvOS e watchOS\",\"excerpt\":\"Apple ha reso disponibile la seconda beta di iOS 26.6, insieme alle beta 2 di iPadOS 26.6, macOS 26.6, tvOS 26.6 e watchOS 26.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/06/iOS-26.6-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"iOS-26.6\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15521,\"date\":\"2026-06-15T09:28:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-06-15T07:28:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"watchos-27-nuove-prestazioni-e-griglia-dinamica-per-le-app\",\"title\":\"watchOS 27: nuove prestazioni e una griglia dinamica per le app\",\"excerpt\":\"watchOS 27 porta miglioramenti prestazionali e una griglia dinamica delle app: cinque app in base al contesto, richiamabili con la Digital Crown. Richiede hardware più recente.\",\"categoryName\":\"Tecnologia\",\"categorySlug\":\"tecnologia\",\"categoryId\":5,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/06/watchos-27-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"watchos-27\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15439,\"date\":\"2026-06-12T14:28:33+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-06-12T18:39:25+00:00\",\"slug\":\"whatsapp-non-funzionera-piu-su-alcuni-iphone-requisiti-ios-15-5\",\"title\":\"WhatsApp non funzionerà più su alcuni iPhone: requisiti iOS aggiornati\",\"excerpt\":\"Dal 30 novembre 2026 WhatsApp richiederà almeno iOS 15.5 su iPhone e iPadOS 15.5 su iPad. Chi non aggiorna potrebbe perdere l’accesso all’app.\",\"categoryName\":\"iOS\",\"categorySlug\":\"ios\",\"categoryId\":14,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/06/Whatsapp-Feature-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Whatsapp-Feature\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15428,\"date\":\"2026-06-12T09:06:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-06-12T18:41:37+00:00\",\"slug\":\"novita-app-foto-ios-27-cosa-cambia\",\"title\":\"Novità nell’app Foto di iOS 27: cosa cambia\",\"excerpt\":\"Panoramica delle principali novità dell’app Foto in iOS 27, con focus su aggiornamenti dell’esperienza d’uso e gestione dei contenuti.\",\"categoryName\":\"iOS\",\"categorySlug\":\"ios\",\"categoryId\":14,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/06/Whats-New-in-the-iOS-27-Photos-App-Feature-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Whats-New-in-the-iOS-27-Photos-App-Feature\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":4,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15409,\"date\":\"2026-06-10T21:35:14+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-06-10T19:35:14+00:00\",\"slug\":\"ios-26-79-adozione-iphone-vigilia-ios-27\",\"title\":\"iOS 26 al 79% sugli iPhone: adozione in vista di iOS 27\",\"excerpt\":\"Alla vigilia dell’arrivo di iOS 27, iOS 26 risulta installato sul 79% degli iPhone. Un dato che fotografa la velocità di adozione della versione in corso e le prospettive per l’upgrade successivo.\",\"categoryName\":\"iOS\",\"categorySlug\":\"ios\",\"categoryId\":14,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/06/ios-26-final-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"ios-26-final\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15353,\"date\":\"2026-06-08T17:01:15+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-06-08T15:01:15+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-rilascia-ios-26-5-1-e-macos-26-5-1-bug-corretti-prima-della-wwdc\",\"title\":\"Apple rilascia iOS 26.5.1 e macOS 26.5.1: due bug corretti prima della WWDC\",\"excerpt\":\"Apple ha pubblicato iOS 26.5.1 e macOS 26.5.1 con correzioni mirate per iPhone Air, iPhone 17 e Mac con chip M5, in vista della WWDC.\",\"categoryName\":\"iOS\",\"categorySlug\":\"ios\",\"categoryId\":14,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/06/ios-26-liquid.jpg-768x384.webp\",\"imageAlt\":\"ios-26-liquid.jpg\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15335,\"date\":\"2026-06-08T12:53:20+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-06-08T10:53:20+00:00\",\"slug\":\"microsoft-cambia-requisiti-office-mac-iphone-vecchi\",\"title\":\"Microsoft cambia i requisiti di Office: attenzione se usate Mac o iPhone vecchi\",\"excerpt\":\"Dal 13 luglio 2026 Microsoft Office richiederà almeno macOS 12 Monterey e iOS 17. Su dispositivi più vecchi i documenti saranno solo consultabili.\",\"categoryName\":\"Applicazioni\",\"categorySlug\":\"applicazioni\",\"categoryId\":13,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/06/microsoft-office-2021-768x410.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"microsoft-office-2021\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":2,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15314,\"date\":\"2026-06-05T11:14:21+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-06-05T09:14:21+00:00\",\"slug\":\"macos-27-wishlist-wwdc-2026-siri-multitasking\",\"title\":\"macOS 27: la wishlist per WWDC 2026 (Siri, multitasking e altro)\",\"excerpt\":\"A pochi giorni dalla keynote WWDC 2026, l’attenzione si allarga anche a macOS 27: Siri, app dedicata, Liquid Glass, multitasking, supporto display esterni e gestione della memoria.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/06/macOS-27-Wishlist-What-Do-You-Want-From-Apple-at-WWDC-2026-Feature-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"macOS-27-Wishlist-What-Do-You-Want-From-Apple-at-WWDC-2026-Feature\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":2,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15312,\"date\":\"2026-06-05T11:14:06+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-06-05T09:14:06+00:00\",\"slug\":\"novita-in-arrivo-con-macos-27\",\"title\":\"5+ novità in arrivo con macOS 27\",\"excerpt\":\"Tra redesign di Liquid Glass, un Siri più evoluto su Mac e aggiornamenti AI per Foto, Safari e Strumenti di scrittura: ecco le principali novità attese in macOS 27.\",\"categoryName\":\"Intelligenza Artificiale\",\"categorySlug\":\"intelligenza-artificiale\",\"categoryId\":188,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/06/5-New-Features-Coming-in-macOS-27-Feature-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"5-New-Features-Coming-in-macOS-27-Feature\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":3,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15275,\"date\":\"2026-06-02T03:15:49+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-06-02T01:15:49+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-pubblica-wallpaper-playlist-video-get-ready-per-wwdc-2026\",\"title\":\"Apple pubblica wallpaper, playlist e video “Get Ready” per WWDC 2026\",\"excerpt\":\"Prima dell’inizio di WWDC 2026, Apple rende disponibili una nuova wallpaper per iPhone, iPad e Mac, una playlist su Apple Music e un video “Get Ready” per prepararsi all’evento.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/06/WWDC-2026-Wallpaper-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"WWDC-2026-Wallpaper\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15273,\"date\":\"2026-06-02T03:15:39+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-06-02T01:15:39+00:00\",\"slug\":\"wwdc-2026-manca-una-settimana-placeholder-youtube-keynote-diretta\",\"title\":\"WWDC 2026, manca una settimana: placeholder YouTube e keynote in diretta\",\"excerpt\":\"A una settimana dall’inizio di WWDC 2026, Apple ha attivato un placeholder su YouTube con promemoria per il keynote del 8 giugno. La diretta sarà disponibile anche su Apple Events e Apple TV.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/06/WWDC26-Glowing-Ring-Feature-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"WWDC26-Glowing-Ring-Feature\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15271,\"date\":\"2026-06-02T03:15:25+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-06-02T01:15:25+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-rilascia-ios-26-5-1-fix-ricarica-iphone-air-iphone-17\",\"title\":\"Apple rilascia iOS 26.5.1: fix per un problema di ricarica su iPhone Air e iPhone 17\",\"excerpt\":\"Apple ha rilasciato iOS 26.5.1, aggiornamento minore di iOS 26 disponibile via OTA. La patch risolve un problema di ricarica cablata su iPhone Air e su tutti i modelli iPhone 17.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/06/iOS-26.5.1-Feature-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"iOS-26.5.1-Feature\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15267,\"date\":\"2026-06-02T03:14:47+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-06-02T01:14:47+00:00\",\"slug\":\"ios-27-nuova-app-siri-dedicata\",\"title\":\"iOS 27: arriva la nuova app Siri dedicata\",\"excerpt\":\"Con iOS 27, iPadOS 27 e macOS 27 debutta per la prima volta un’app Siri standalone: uno spazio dedicato per conversare, cercare sul web e usare dati personali.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/06/Finder-Siri-Feature-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Finder-Siri-Feature\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15259,\"date\":\"2026-06-01T14:30:06+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-31T22:39:02+00:00\",\"slug\":\"ios-27-macbook-ultra-iphone-pieghevole-novita-in-arrivo\",\"title\":\"iOS 27, MacBook Ultra e iPhone pieghevole: le novità in arrivo\",\"excerpt\":\"Nuovi leak su Siri in iOS 27, rumor su un possibile “MacBook Ultra”, aggiornamenti su Apple Watch per il monitoraggio glicemico e prime indicazioni sull’iPhone pieghevole.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/06/top-stories-2026-05-30-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"top-stories-2026-05-30\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15253,\"date\":\"2026-06-01T12:00:38+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-31T22:38:48+00:00\",\"slug\":\"nuovi-apple-tv-4k-homepod-mini-quasi-pronti-siri-aggiornata-attesa\",\"title\":\"Nuovi Apple TV 4K e HomePod mini “quasi pronti”: Siri aggiornata attesa\",\"excerpt\":\"Secondo Mark Gurman, Apple TV 4K e HomePod mini sarebbero pronti da mesi, ma il lancio slitterebbe finché non arriva Siri più personalizzata.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/06/HomePod-mini-and-Apple-TV-Sage-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"HomePod-mini-and-Apple-TV-Sage\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15230,\"date\":\"2026-05-30T17:30:24+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-29T23:24:37+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-prime-beta-pubbliche-ios-26-6-macos-tahoe-26-6\",\"title\":\"Apple rilascia le prime beta pubbliche di iOS 26.6 e macOS Tahoe 26.6\",\"excerpt\":\"Disponibili le prime beta pubbliche di iOS 26.6, iPadOS 26.6, macOS Tahoe 26.6, watchOS 26.6 e tvOS 26.6. Arrivano due giorni dopo le beta per sviluppatori.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/05/iOS-26.6-Glass-Feature-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"iOS-26.6-Glass-Feature\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":2,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15150,\"date\":\"2026-05-27T18:30:50+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-27T16:30:50+00:00\",\"slug\":\"ios-26-6-avviso-limite-contatti-bloccati\",\"title\":\"iOS 26.6: avviso quando si raggiunge il limite dei contatti bloccati\",\"excerpt\":\"Nella beta di iOS 26.6 emergono nuove diciture: possibile avviso quando si raggiunge il numero massimo di contatti bloccati. Non è chiaro se i limiti cambino.\",\"categoryName\":\"iOS\",\"categorySlug\":\"ios\",\"categoryId\":14,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/05/iOS-26-Phone-App-Features-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"iOS-26-Phone-App-Features\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"