i tra salute, watch face e satelliti (rumor)\",\"excerpt\":\"Rumor su watchOS 27: miglioramenti al tracciamento della frequenza cardiaca, nuove watch face e possibili funzioni satellitari. Focus anche su stabilità e performance.\",\"categoryName\":\"Watch\",\"categorySlug\":\"watch\",\"categoryId\":186,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/05/Apple-Watch-Ultra-2-Black-Titanium-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Apple-Watch-Ultra-2-Black-Titanium\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":2,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15126,\"date\":\"2026-05-25T09:30:17+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-25T06:34:41+00:00\",\"slug\":\"ios-27-rumor-menu-airpods-siri-opzioni-airplay\",\"title\":\"iOS 27, i rumor su menu AirPods, Siri e opzioni AirPlay\",\"excerpt\":\"Nuovi rumor su iOS 27: menu impostazioni AirPods riorganizzato, miglioramenti a Genmoji e Image Playground, nuove opzioni AirPlay e una nuova interfaccia Siri scura.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/05/iOS-27-on-iPhone-17-1-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"iOS-27-on-iPhone-17-1\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15123,\"date\":\"2026-05-24T15:13:28+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-24T13:13:28+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-prepara-genai-apple-com-in-vista-del-wwdc-2026\",\"title\":\"Apple prepara genai.apple.com in vista del WWDC 2026\",\"excerpt\":\"Spunta il sottodominio genai.apple.com su DNS Apple, in anticipo sul WWDC 2026. Non risulta ancora collegato a una pagina attiva.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/05/Apple-Intelligence-General-Feature-2-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Apple-Intelligence-General-Feature-2\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":2,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15100,\"date\":\"2026-05-23T16:30:50+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-23T16:00:37+00:00\",\"slug\":\"wwdc-2026-siri-riprogettato-accessibilita-ios-27\",\"title\":\"WWDC 2026: Siri riprogettato e nuove funzioni di accessibilità in iOS 27\",\"excerpt\":\"Apple conferma WWDC 2026 (8-12 giugno). Attese novità su iOS 27, con un Siri ripensato, funzioni di accessibilità e aggiornamenti per iOS 27 e altri sistemi.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/05/TMRS-195-WWDC-2026-Promises-Apple-Intelligence-and-Siri-Upgrades-Thumb-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"TMRS-195-WWDC-2026-Promises-Apple-Intelligence-and-Siri-Upgrades-Thumb\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":0,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15095,\"date\":\"2026-05-23T12:00:26+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-23T15:59:46+00:00\",\"slug\":\"ios-26-5-1-in-test-possibile-rilascio-entro-fine-prossima-settimana\",\"title\":\"iOS 26.5.1 in test: possibile rilascio entro la fine della prossima settimana\",\"excerpt\":\"Test in corso per iOS 26.5.1 su iPhone: dai log di accesso emergono anche segnali su iOS 26.6 e sull’attenzione di Apple verso iOS 27.\",\"categoryName\":\"iOS\",\"categorySlug\":\"ios\",\"categoryId\":14,\"imageUrl\":\"