32.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"whatsapp-wabetainfo-share-sheet402x\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":2,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15001,\"date\":\"2026-05-20T11:30:24+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-20T09:58:10+00:00\",\"slug\":\"google-io-2026-gemini-3-5-ai-search-android-xr-glasses\",\"title\":\"Google I/O 2026: Gemini 3.5, AI Search e Android XR Glasses\",\"excerpt\":\"A Google I/O 2026 arrivano Gemini Omni e Gemini 3.5 Flash, l’evoluzione di AI Search e AI Overviews, e le prime Android XR audio glasses. Novità anche su Docs e YouTube.\",\"categoryName\":\"Intelligenza Artificiale\",\"categorySlug\":\"intelligenza-artificiale\",\"categoryId\":188,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/05/google-io-2026-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"google-io-2026\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":2,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":14974,\"date\":\"2026-05-19T14:30:26+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-19T08:06:38+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-programma-wwdc-2026-inviti-media\",\"title\":\"Apple pubblica il programma di WWDC 2026 e invia inviti ai media\",\"excerpt\":\"WWDC 2026 si terrà dal 8 al 12 giugno. La keynote inizierà alle 10:00 PT (1:00 ET) e sarà disponibile in streaming su Apple.com, Apple TV e YouTube.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/05/wwdc-apple-park-in-person-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"wwdc-apple-park-in-person\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4